霍莉说：嘿，大家好。

1360
01:02:36.310 --> 01:02:40.070
Michael says, this is where our love faced its toughest teSt.
迈克尔说：这是我们爱情经历最严峻考验的地方。

1361
01:02:40.290 --> 01:02:43.790
After this, smooth sailing for the rest of our lives.
过了这一关，我们余生就一帆风顺了。

1362
01:02:44.510 --> 01:02:48.010
And then it says, Holly is nervous with anticipation.
剧本上写着：霍莉满怀期待，有些紧张。

1363
01:02:48.710 --> 01:02:53.530
Michael, confident and cool, takes her arm and walks her through the room.
迈克尔自信而从容地挽起她的手臂，带她穿过房间。

1364
01:02:53.530 --> 01:02:58.910
And then one by one, different people ask Holly if she will marry them.
然后大家一个接一个地问霍莉愿不愿意嫁给他们。

1365
01:02:59.010 --> 01:03:01.770
And she has to say no to each person.
她必须对每个人说不。

1366
01:03:01.950 --> 01:03:03.730
This was my line in the episode.
这是我在这一集里的台词。

1367
01:03:04.090 --> 01:03:04.590
Yes.
是的。

1368
01:03:04.810 --> 01:03:05.690
Look, you marry me.
听着，你嫁给我吧。

1369
01:03:07.250 --> 01:03:08.670
And I loved this.
我太喜欢这段了。

1370
01:03:08.730 --> 01:03:15.530
I don't know if you noticed in Amy Ryan's performance, but from the minute that door opens and she sees all of us holding the candles,
不知道你们有没有注意到艾米·瑞恩的表演，从门打开那一刻，她看到我们所有人拿着蜡烛时，

1371
01:03:15.530 --> 01:03:19.950
she immediately gets tears in her eyes and a lump in her throat.
她的眼眶立刻湿润了，喉咙也哽咽了。

1372
01:03:20.210 --> 01:03:23.690
Like, you can just hear it and you can see this flush on her face.
你能听出来，也能看到她脸上的潮红。

1373
01:03:23.810 --> 01:03:24.710
It's just beautiful.
真是太美了。

1374
01:03:25.150 --> 01:03:31.830
Every single minute of this scene, Amy is like a master class in acting, just watching her.
这场戏的每一分钟，艾米的表演都堪称大师级，看着她就是一种享受。

1375
01:03:32.310 --> 01:03:40.370
So, after they get through this row of people, they get back into the annex, which is lit with more candles than I've ever seen, ever.
他们穿过人群回到附楼，那里点满了蜡烛，数量多到我前所未见。

1376
01:03:40.970 --> 01:03:44.770
Clearly, Michael had help because how do you set up this many candles?
显然，迈克尔找人帮忙了，不然他怎么可能摆出这么多蜡烛？

1377
01:03:44.890 --> 01:03:51.390
It's like in a reality TV show when The Bachelor or whatever takes them back to the mansion and there's like 400 candles.
就像真人秀《钻石单身汉》之类的节目，把人带回豪宅时，里面摆着四百多支蜡烛一样。

1378
01:03:51.410 --> 01:03:54.410
I'm always like, okay, can we call BS on how many candles?
我总是想，好吧，我们能质疑一下这蜡烛数量吗？

1379
01:03:54.410 --> 01:04:08.090
Well, Michael and Holly both get on their knees and he's about to say, this is where we fixed that broken chair, but then the sprinklers go off and douse them with water.
迈克尔和霍莉都跪了下来，他正要说“这就是我们修好那把坏椅子的地方”，结果喷淋系统启动，把他们浇成了落汤鸡。

1380
01:04:08.630 --> 01:04:10.910
But Michael still pulls out the ring.
但迈克尔还是拿出了戒指。

1381
01:04:11.110 --> 01:04:14.910
He proposes in his Yoda voice and Holly accepts.
他用尤达大师的声音求婚，霍莉答应了。

1382
01:04:15.290 --> 01:04:16.530
In her Yoda voice.
她也用尤达大师的声音回应。

1383
01:04:17.750 --> 01:04:21.530
And we all burst through into the annex.
然后我们所有人都冲进了附楼。

1384
01:04:21.530 --> 01:04:23.250
We're all soaking wet.
我们全都湿透了。

1385
01:04:23.410 --> 01:04:28.570
And this is the line that when I saw it in our rewatch made me sob.
重温这一集时，这句台词让我泪流满面。

1386
01:04:28.970 --> 01:04:34.890
And I don't even know if I can say it now because I remember how it felt when we did the scene.
我甚至不知道现在能不能把它说出来，因为我记得当时拍这场戏时的感受。

1387
01:04:35.250 --> 01:04:37.390
He says, you know, she said yes.
他说：你们知道吗，她答应了。

1388
01:04:37.570 --> 01:04:41.290
And then he says, Michael says, and I'm leaving.
然后他说，迈克尔说：我要离开了。

1389
01:04:41.630 --> 01:04:41.990
Yeah.
是的。

1390
01:04:42.350 --> 01:04:45.830
And it was the first time Steve had really said it out loud to us.
那是史蒂夫第一次真正对我们大声说出来。

1391
01:04:46.010 --> 01:04:46.230
Yeah.
是的。

1392
01:04:46.230 --> 01:04:46.930
We all knew.
我们都知道。

1393
01:04:47.090 --> 01:04:48.090
We knew he was leaving.
我们知道他要走。

1394
01:04:48.870 --> 01:04:50.110
We knew it was coming.
我们知道这一天终会到来。

1395
01:04:50.870 --> 01:05:02.690
But when he said it in the episode, I remember when they cut to the looks on our faces, that was because we were hearing Steve Carell, our friend, say, I'm leaving to us.
但当他在剧中说出来时，我记得镜头切到我们的表情，那是因为我们听到了我们的朋友史蒂夫·卡瑞尔对我们说：我要离开了。

1396
01:05:02.830 --> 01:05:04.010
It was so real.
那太真实了。

1397
01:05:04.030 --> 01:05:04.730
Really for the first time.
真的是第一次。

1398
01:05:04.730 --> 01:05:04.950
Yeah.
是的。

1399
01:05:05.090 --> 01:05:05.990
It was so real.
太真实了。

1400
01:05:06.490 --> 01:05:10.750
And I just, like, I experienced that emotion all over again in this rewatch.
在这次重温中，我仿佛又重新体验了一遍那种情绪。

1401
01:05:11.230 --> 01:05:20.350
I remember so clearly that moment because we were all so happy when she said yes.
我清楚地记得那一刻，因为当她答应的时候，我们所有人都非常开心。

1402
01:05:20.350 --> 01:05:20.890
We were.
确实如此。

1403
01:05:21.030 --> 01:05:26.730
Like, we were, as fans of our own show, we were so happy that Holly and Michael found each other.
作为我们自己节目的粉丝，我们都为霍莉和迈克尔能走到一起感到无比高兴。

1404
01:05:26.730 --> 01:05:28.690
And the water was so cold.
而且水真的很冷。

1405
01:05:28.810 --> 01:05:30.730
And we were all really reacting to that.
我们当时的反应都是真实的。

1406
01:05:30.910 --> 01:05:32.430
We all got soaking wet.
我们全都湿透了。

1407
01:05:32.650 --> 01:05:36.530
So there was this huge sort of well of emotion of happiness.
所以当时那种幸福感简直如泉涌般喷薄而出。

1408
01:05:36.530 --> 01:05:37.910
And, oh, my God, it's so cold.
天哪，真的太冷了。

1409
01:05:38.050 --> 01:05:43.530
And then when Steve, as Michael said, I'm leaving, it was like the air sucked out of the room.
然后当史蒂夫以迈克尔的身份说出“我要离开了”时，房间里的空气仿佛瞬间被抽干了。

1410
01:05:43.670 --> 01:05:47.010
It was just so many things happening at once.
当时真的有太多事情同时发生了。

1411
01:05:47.010 --> 01:05:52.670
And it was so powerful as just Steve's friend and co-worker.
作为史蒂夫的朋友和同事，那一刻真的非常有冲击力。

1412
01:05:52.950 --> 01:05:53.230
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1413
01:05:53.770 --> 01:05:58.650
You can imagine we got a fan mail flurry about this scene.
你可以想象，关于这场戏我们收到了如雪片般的粉丝来信。

1414
01:05:59.150 --> 01:06:00.190
Kyle S.
来自不列颠哥伦比亚省维多利亚市的凯尔·S说道：

1415
01:06:00.350 --> 01:06:02.270
in Victoria, British Columbia said,
“关于这场求婚戏的技术层面，我有太多的问题了。”

1416
01:06:02.390 --> 01:06:06.730
I have so many questions about the technical side of this proposal scene.
“迈克尔求婚时所有的蜡烛都是真的在燃烧吗？还是有后期特效？”

1417
01:06:06.950 --> 01:06:12.530
Were all of the candles really burning in Michael's proposal or were any of them CGI?
“拍摄那场戏之前的安全会议是怎么开的？”

1418
01:06:12.970 --> 01:06:16.050
What was the safety meeting like for shooting that scene?
“为了让附楼被水彻底淹没，在布景准备上做了哪些工作？”

1419
01:06:16.050 --> 01:06:21.490
And what went into preparing the set of the annex for being completely destroyed by water
“以便它能重置以进行下一次拍摄或拍摄下一集？”

1420
01:06:21.490 --> 01:06:25.830
so that it could either be reset for another take or another episode?
“好吧，我们从兰迪那里得到了所有细节。”

1421
01:06:26.590 --> 01:06:28.490
Well, we got all the details from Randy.
我们确实得到了。

1422
01:06:28.730 --> 01:06:29.450
We sure did.
首先，所有的蜡烛都是货真价实的。

1423
01:06:29.790 --> 01:06:32.530
First of all, all of the candles were very real.
我记得凯利当时说了类似这样的话。

1424
01:06:32.810 --> 01:06:36.070
I like to remember Kelly saying something like this.
“安全会议！”

1425
01:06:36.350 --> 01:06:37.430
Safety meeting!
“我们有372支点燃的蜡烛！”

1426
01:06:37.650 --> 01:06:40.830
We have 372 lit candles!
没错。

1427
01:06:41.110 --> 01:06:41.670
Exactly.
不过兰迪提到，正如你所说，安吉拉，点燃所有蜡烛，

1428
01:06:43.390 --> 01:06:48.330
Randy mentioned, though, that lighting all the candles, like you said, Angela,
迈克尔肯定得到了帮助。

1429
01:06:48.630 --> 01:06:50.030
Michael must have had help.
这绝不是一个人能完成的工作。

1430
01:06:50.170 --> 01:06:52.810
Well, this was not the job of one person.
我们是这样做的。

1431
01:06:53.210 --> 01:06:54.470
Here's how we did it.
兰迪说，这需要一个由三个人组成的特效团队，

1432
01:06:54.670 --> 01:06:58.590
Randy said that it took a special effects team of three people,
加上我们四人的布景装饰组，

1433
01:06:58.730 --> 01:07:01.930
plus our set dressing crew of four people,
再加上由八人组成的道具和美术部门工作人员。

1434
01:07:02.110 --> 01:07:06.630
plus all of our prop and art department crew consisting of eight people.
所以，那是多少人？

1435
01:07:06.630 --> 01:07:08.390
So, what is that?
八加四加三，一共15个人。

1436
01:07:08.730 --> 01:07:12.370
Eight plus four plus three, 15 people.
才促成了这一刻的实现。

1437
01:07:12.610 --> 01:07:14.110
To make this moment happen.
是的。

1438
01:07:14.370 --> 01:07:14.730
Yes.
每个人都拿了一个壁炉点火器，

1439
01:07:14.930 --> 01:07:17.410
Every person got a fireplace lighter,
凯利·坎特利在宣布完安全注意事项后会说：

1440
01:07:18.010 --> 01:07:22.150
and Kelly Cantley, after her safety announcement, would say,
“开始”，然后这些人就能在几分钟内点燃所有蜡烛。

1441
01:07:22.370 --> 01:07:26.110
go, and those people could light all those candles in just a few minutes.
你知道，因为他们必须在喊“开始”之前立刻完成，

1442
01:07:26.270 --> 01:07:28.870
You know, because they had to do it right before action,
因为我们不能让那些蜡烛一直烧着。

1443
01:07:28.870 --> 01:07:30.950
because we couldn't leave those candles burning.
兰迪说，这些蜡烛实际上产生了大量的热量和烟雾。

1444
01:07:30.950 --> 01:07:38.270
Randy said there was actually a significant amount of heat and fumes caused by these candles.
如果我们让它们燃烧太久，就会触发真正的火灾报警器。

1445
01:07:38.370 --> 01:07:44.450
And we had actual fire alarms that they would trigger if we let them burning too long.
兰迪说，我们的制作设计师迈克尔·加伦伯格，

1446
01:07:44.750 --> 01:07:48.830
Randy said that Michael Gallenberg, who was our production designer,
和我们的施工协调员蒂姆·詹姆斯，

1447
01:07:48.970 --> 01:07:50.770
and Tim James, our construction coordinator,
实际上在附楼上方安装了特殊的排气扇和空气净化器来循环空气。

1448
01:07:51.110 --> 01:07:58.610
actually installed special exhaust fans and air scrubbers above the annex to recycle the air.
但我们在拍摄时不能运行它们。

1449
01:07:59.190 --> 01:08:01.430
But we couldn't run them while we were filming.
所以，这就是为什么我们必须在点燃蜡烛后迅速开始拍摄的原因。

1450
01:08:01.810 --> 01:08:05.070
So, that's why we had to light the candles and start shooting really quickly.
没错。

1451
01:08:05.790 --> 01:08:10.530
And then in terms of the sprinklers, I did not realize how much work went into this.
至于喷淋系统，我之前没意识到这需要做这么多工作。

1452
01:08:10.770 --> 01:08:14.170
When we got these details from Randy, I was, wow.
当我们从兰迪那里拿到这些细节时，我当时就惊呆了。

1453
01:08:14.810 --> 01:08:20.050
I mean, they had to soak all of the annex, plus the kitchen.
我是说，他们得把整个附楼和厨房都淋透。

1454
01:08:20.930 --> 01:08:21.970
It was crazy.
这太疯狂了。

1455
01:08:22.410 --> 01:08:23.630
Here's what they had to do.
以下是他们必须做的工作。

1456
01:08:23.970 --> 01:08:28.510
The previous weekend, Tim James' crew took all of the furniture
上个周末，蒂姆·詹姆斯的团队把所有的家具

1457
01:08:28.510 --> 01:08:30.770
and set dressing out of the kitchen and annex.
和布景装饰都从厨房和附楼里搬了出来。

1458
01:08:30.990 --> 01:08:35.390
They removed the walls and the carpet down to the bare stage floor.
他们拆掉了墙壁和地毯，露出了光秃秃的舞台地板。

1459
01:08:36.010 --> 01:08:40.930
Then they added a waterproofing floor liner to go underneath
然后他们加了一层防水地垫铺在下面，

1460
01:08:40.930 --> 01:08:46.030
and then rebuilt the entire set to sit inside of a pan.
接着重建了整个布景，让它坐落在一个托盘里。

1461
01:08:46.210 --> 01:08:46.710
Wow.
哇。

1462
01:08:46.910 --> 01:08:50.430
Which is like a low bathtub thing that would collect all the water
那就像一个低矮的浴缸，用来收集所有的水，

1463
01:08:50.430 --> 01:08:55.410
so it wouldn't ruin our actual stage floor or any of the adjacent sets.
这样就不会毁掉我们真正的舞台地板或任何相邻的布景。

1464
01:08:55.410 --> 01:08:59.310
Because you don't want to get that water stuck in there and get mold and stuff.
因为你肯定不想让水积在那里导致发霉之类的。

1465
01:09:00.110 --> 01:09:04.590
Then all of the lighting and electrical cables had to be grounded, waterproofed,
然后所有的照明和电缆都必须接地、做防水处理，

1466
01:09:04.610 --> 01:09:08.890
and they had to have a safety inspection from a rep at Universal Studios.
而且必须通过环球影城代表的安全检查。

1467
01:09:08.890 --> 01:09:16.590
They had to build a huge grid of PVC pipes over the annex and kitchen with sprinklers
他们必须在附楼和厨房上方搭建一个巨大的PVC管道网，并装上喷头，

1468
01:09:17.350 --> 01:09:20.310
that would believably sprinkle the water.
这样喷出来的水看起来才真实。

1469
01:09:20.730 --> 01:09:24.830
But we also had to prime the sprinklers beforehand
但我们还得提前给喷淋系统预充水，

1470
01:09:24.830 --> 01:09:30.650
because where the water tank was was kind of far away from all the pipes.
因为水箱离所有的管道有点远。

1471
01:09:30.650 --> 01:09:33.790
And we needed the water to come out right on cue.
我们需要水在指令下达时立刻喷出来。

1472
01:09:34.030 --> 01:09:36.590
So we couldn't wait for that lag time.
所以我们不能等待那段延迟时间。

1473
01:09:37.090 --> 01:09:43.630
So they would turn it on and put big buckets down to collect the little bit of sprinkle,
所以他们会先打开开关，放上大桶来收集那一点点喷出来的水，

1474
01:09:43.770 --> 01:09:44.330
turn it off.
然后再关掉。

1475
01:09:44.650 --> 01:09:48.290
And then when they said action, then it would come right out.
等到他们喊“开始”时，水就会立刻喷出来。

1476
01:09:48.870 --> 01:09:53.650
I guess the special effects team used a boiler tank
我猜特效团队用了一个锅炉水箱，

1477
01:09:53.650 --> 01:09:57.110
so that the water would not be like totally freezing cold.
这样水就不会冷得刺骨。

1478
01:09:57.110 --> 01:10:02.190
But Randy said during our setup, the water cooled inside the pipes.
但兰迪说在我们布置期间，水在管道里变凉了。

1479
01:10:02.190 --> 01:10:04.370
So the first blast was really cold.
所以第一波喷出来的水非常冷。

1480
01:10:04.370 --> 01:10:07.930
He said, as evidenced by Amy Ryan's face and reaction.
他说，从艾米·瑞安的表情和反应就能看出来。

1481
01:10:08.230 --> 01:10:09.990
I thought it was so perfect, though.
不过我觉得这太完美了。

1482
01:10:10.290 --> 01:10:12.250
I mean, that water was cold.
我是说，那水确实很冷。

1483
01:10:12.410 --> 01:10:14.270
I remember it being very cold.
我记得当时非常冷。

1484
01:10:14.530 --> 01:10:16.850
Plus, our soundstage was freezing.
再加上我们的摄影棚里冷得要命。

1485
01:10:17.310 --> 01:10:17.590
Yeah.
没错。

1486
01:10:17.730 --> 01:10:19.010
So you're already cold.
所以你本来就已经很冷了。

1487
01:10:19.010 --> 01:10:20.310
And then it was cold water.
然后又是冷水。

1488
01:10:20.450 --> 01:10:23.890
But it made for such a cute, sweet, fun reaction.
但这造就了一个非常可爱、甜蜜又有趣的反应。

1489
01:10:23.890 --> 01:10:28.590
We got another fan question from Brianna Ellen, Katie, Texas, who wanted to know
我们收到了来自德克萨斯州凯蒂市布里安娜·艾伦的另一个粉丝提问，她想知道

1490
01:10:28.590 --> 01:10:32.610
how many times did we have to get soaking wet for this proposal scene?
为了这场求婚戏，我们一共被淋湿了多少次？

1491
01:10:33.230 --> 01:10:37.050
Randy said we shot the scene on Wednesday, February 2nd.
兰迪说我们是在2月2日星期三拍摄那场戏的。

1492
01:10:37.490 --> 01:10:42.170
He said we were prepared to do a massive cleanup and go again the next day.
他说我们准备好了进行大规模清理，第二天再拍一次。

1493
01:10:42.270 --> 01:10:44.910
And then again on Friday if we needed to.
如果需要的话，周五再拍一次。

1494
01:10:45.110 --> 01:10:46.570
So we had three chances to get it.
所以我们有三次机会来完成它。

1495
01:10:46.650 --> 01:10:49.470
But there was no way to turn it over in a single day.
但要在一天之内完成清理是不可能的。

1496
01:10:50.070 --> 01:10:52.550
But Randy said we got it on the first take.
不过兰迪说我们一条就过了。

1497
01:10:52.550 --> 01:10:54.530
Like, yeah, that was my memory, too.
没错，我的记忆也是这样。

1498
01:10:54.750 --> 01:10:59.230
I remember, though, that they did turn off the sprinklers for a second.
不过我记得他们确实关了一会儿喷淋系统。

1499
01:10:59.610 --> 01:11:01.430
And we all put on robes.
我们都穿上了长袍。

1500
01:11:01.510 --> 01:11:02.450
And we were kind of shivering.
当时我们都在发抖。

1501
01:11:02.450 --> 01:11:05.370
And they were watching the footage to make sure we had it.
他们当时在看拍摄素材，确保我们拍到了。

1502
01:11:05.530 --> 01:11:05.690
Yeah.
是啊。

1503
01:11:05.850 --> 01:11:07.890
And then they turned the sprinklers on again.
然后他们又打开了喷水装置。

1504
01:11:07.890 --> 01:11:10.750
And they got a couple of extra reaction shots.
他们又补拍了一些额外的反应镜头。

1505
01:11:11.270 --> 01:11:12.170
And then we were done.
然后我们就收工了。

1506
01:11:12.410 --> 01:11:12.570
Yeah.
是啊。

1507
01:11:12.890 --> 01:11:14.950
I watched this episode with my daughter.
我和我女儿一起看了这一集。

1508
01:11:15.030 --> 01:11:19.930
And she was like, Mom, you're so happy for Michael and Holly.
她说，妈妈，你为迈克尔和霍莉感到好高兴啊。

1509
01:11:19.930 --> 01:11:22.750
Because I run in with everyone else cheering.
因为我当时也跟着大家一起跑过去欢呼。

1510
01:11:23.150 --> 01:11:29.450
And I said, yeah, I think, honestly, Isabel, even Angela Martin was happy that Michael found his person.
我说，是啊，伊莎贝尔，说实话，我觉得连安吉拉·马丁都为迈克尔找到了真爱而感到高兴。

1511
01:11:30.190 --> 01:11:31.750
Maybe happy that he's leaving.
也许是因为他要走了才高兴吧。

1512
01:11:32.090 --> 01:11:33.730
Maybe one of the people.
也许是其中一个原因。

1513
01:11:34.610 --> 01:11:39.150
Well, Angela, we got one more piece of fan mail about this proposal scene from Madison C.
好了，安吉拉，我们还收到了一封关于这场求婚戏的粉丝来信，来自马里兰州巴尔的摩的麦迪逊·C。

1514
01:11:39.150 --> 01:11:44.930
in Baltimore, Maryland, who said, I don't have a question, but I wanted to share a story related to this episode.
她说，我没有问题，但我很想分享一个和这一集有关的故事。

1515
01:11:45.590 --> 01:11:50.030
My husband proposed to me on December 31st, 2018.
我丈夫在2018年12月31日向我求婚。

1516
01:11:50.070 --> 01:11:54.250
And he recreated the Holly and Michael proposal from this episode.
他重现了这一集中霍莉和迈克尔求婚的场景。

1517
01:11:54.470 --> 01:12:01.010
He had our friends line up holding candles and recite the lines that the characters said in the episode.
他让我们的朋友排成两排，手里拿着蜡烛，背诵剧中角色说过的台词。

1518
01:12:01.010 --> 01:12:05.850
I was so surprised, and it was such a cool proposal since I'm such a huge fan.
我当时太惊喜了，作为一个超级粉丝，这真是一场超酷的求婚。

1519
01:12:06.090 --> 01:12:06.950
Love you, ladies.
爱你们，女士们。

1520
01:12:07.290 --> 01:12:08.190
So cute.
太可爱了。

1521
01:12:08.410 --> 01:12:09.190
Yeah, I love that.
是啊，我喜欢这个。

1522
01:12:09.250 --> 01:12:09.910
So creative.
太有创意了。

1523
01:12:10.250 --> 01:12:11.050
Thanks for sharing.
谢谢你的分享。

1524
01:12:11.050 --> 01:12:11.870
I love that.
我喜欢这个故事。

1525
01:12:12.610 --> 01:12:16.090
Well, this episode is going to end with more of Jim's prank.
好了，这一集将以吉姆的更多恶作剧结束。

1526
01:12:16.690 --> 01:12:21.030
Dwight is watering five big planters of the legumes.
德怀特正在给五个大花盆里的豆科植物浇水。

1527
01:12:21.230 --> 01:12:22.150
He's planted them.
他把它们种下了。

1528
01:12:22.390 --> 01:12:29.290
And when he steps away, Jim sneaks around the corner with almost full-grown potted plants.
当他走开时，吉姆带着几乎长成的盆栽从拐角处溜了过来。

1529
01:12:29.370 --> 01:12:29.750
Yes.
没错。

1530
01:12:29.750 --> 01:12:32.530
As if after Dwight watered them, they immediately grew.
就好像德怀特浇完水后，它们立刻就长出来了一样。

1531
01:12:32.710 --> 01:12:33.350
Well, they're magical.
嗯，它们是有魔力的。

1532
01:12:33.530 --> 01:12:33.870
I know.
我知道。

1533
01:12:33.910 --> 01:12:34.350
Of course.
当然了。

1534
01:12:34.530 --> 01:12:34.790
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1535
01:12:35.050 --> 01:12:40.130
We did have a fan question from Little K in Israel.
我们确实收到一个来自以色列的小K的粉丝提问。

1536
01:12:40.750 --> 01:12:42.310
Dwight has a huge farm.
德怀特有一个巨大的农场。

1537
01:12:42.650 --> 01:12:46.310
Why would he plant the seeds in pots in the Dunder Mifflin parking lot?
他为什么要在邓德·米夫林停车场的花盆里种种子呢？

1538
01:12:46.450 --> 01:12:47.190
This is a good point.
这话说得好。

1539
01:12:47.190 --> 01:12:47.990
This is a fair question.
这是一个合理的问题。

1540
01:12:47.990 --> 01:12:48.990
This is a fair question.
这是一个合理的问题。

1541
01:12:49.090 --> 01:12:50.150
I had not thought of that.
我之前没想过这一点。

1542
01:12:50.510 --> 01:12:52.170
You know what I thought when I saw this?
你知道我看到这一幕时在想什么吗？

1543
01:12:52.190 --> 01:12:53.350
Because I love plants.
因为我热爱植物。

1544
01:12:53.830 --> 01:12:57.110
I've been planting quite a bit of new plants in my backyard.
我最近在后院种了不少新植物。

1545
01:12:57.210 --> 01:12:57.710
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1546
01:12:57.710 --> 01:13:00.530
I want to know what Jim's prank budget is.
我想知道吉姆的恶作剧预算是多少。

1547
01:13:00.730 --> 01:13:03.270
And does Pam know about this prank budget?
帕姆知道这个恶作剧预算吗？

1548
01:13:03.390 --> 01:13:05.990
Because those mature plants are not cheap.
因为那些成熟的植物可不便宜。

1549
01:13:06.230 --> 01:13:07.410
You're so right.
你说得太对了。

1550
01:13:07.790 --> 01:13:08.750
I'm just saying.
我只是随口一说。

1551
01:13:08.970 --> 01:13:11.890
How much money does he spend on pranking Dwight each year?
他每年花多少钱在捉弄Dwight上？

1552
01:13:12.210 --> 01:13:12.530
Yeah.
没错。

1553
01:13:13.550 --> 01:13:14.810
Well, listen, guys.
好了，听着，伙计们。

1554
01:13:15.030 --> 01:13:16.410
That's garage sale.
那是车库大甩卖。

1555
01:13:16.710 --> 01:13:20.430
Thank you so much for listening and sending in your questions and comments.
非常感谢你们的倾听，以及发来的问题和评论。

1556
01:13:20.770 --> 01:13:24.850
Thank you always to Randy Cordray for great behind-the-scenes information.
一直以来都要感谢Randy Cordray提供的精彩幕后信息。

1557
01:13:25.150 --> 01:13:31.190
And I guess we're going to go get our boxes and we're going to move somewhere.
我想我们要去拿箱子，然后搬到某个地方去了。

1558
01:13:31.310 --> 01:13:32.230
We don't know.
我们还不知道。

1559
01:13:32.230 --> 01:13:33.410
We really don't know.
我们真的不知道。

1560
01:13:33.610 --> 01:13:39.190
That's what's crazy is we're recording an episode next week and we're not sure where we're recording it.
疯狂的是，我们下周要录制一期节目，但还不确定在哪里录。

1561
01:13:39.190 --> 01:13:41.690
And we'll let you know next week where we landed.
下周我们会告诉你们我们最终落脚在哪里。

1562
01:13:42.150 --> 01:13:42.790
All right, you guys.
好了，各位。

1563
01:13:42.930 --> 01:13:43.490
Have a great one.
祝你们过得愉快。

1564
01:13:43.590 --> 01:13:44.090
We love you.
我们爱你们。

1565
01:13:44.210 --> 01:13:44.810
See you then.
到时候见。

1566
01:13:50.320 --> 01:13:52.260
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《Office Ladies》。

